If you like what we do, you can support us on Patreon!

00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:14.502
You can see the videos one week ahead,
 and without advertisements.

00:42:14.502 --> 00:42:16.360
That would be very helpful for us!

00:42:16.560 --> 00:42:20.520
Otherwise, you can always subscribe and comment,
to help us with the algorithm.

00:42:21.160 --> 00:42:23.440
Thank you for watching, and see you in the next update.

